     "email_body": "<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"primary\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-primary-background-color has-background\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":881668,\"width\":\"200px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/pricing/\"><img src=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/logo-5.png\" alt=\"GravityKit\" class=\"wp-image-881668\" style=\"width:200px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"filter-md\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-filter-md-font-size\">Hi {{contact.first_name|there}},</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You assigned your first license to a client. Thank you for trying the agency tools. Here's $100 toward your next license:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:22px;letter-spacing:2px;\">{{contact.custom.gk_agency_reward_code}}</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Enter it at checkout. It works once and expires on {{contact.custom.gk_agency_reward_expires}}.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#1877f2\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/pricing/\" style=\"background-color:#1877f2\">Buy a License</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Buying for a client? Add their name and email at checkout and the license is assigned to them for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Zack Katz<br>Founder, GravityKit</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
